      "writtenOn": "2026-01-07T22:30:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "are these abseil dependencies used in the *interface* to dawn_common?  If yes, then this seems fine. Otherwise it seems wrong.",
      "parentUuid": "8810b636_b7a1a82d",
      "revId": "5c37749dbd03a39c19a1379f5d4297452742be83",
