      "message": "ok, so it seems the overall answer is \"yes\": if you include dawn_common headers then you also need the abseil code linked in.   (At least that\u0027s what I meant by the question).\n\nAs long as this is being done for a reason, I\u0027m fine with it, even if it could be refined later on.",
